{"text":"מניחים ס״ת שני אצל הראשון ואומרים חצי קדיש על שניהם,"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"The second scroll of the Torah is then placed next to the first on the reading desk and the Reader says half-kaddish."}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n                "}
{"start":"j:transclude","attrs":{"type":"external","target":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:kaddish/chatzi"}}
