{"tail":"\n                "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction"}}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"ומגביהים וגוללים ס״ת שקראו בו, ופותחים ס״ת ב׳ וקוראים בו למפטיר בפ׳ פינחס."}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"The first scroll is then raised and rolled together. After that, the second scroll is unrolled and someone is called to the reading for Maphtir which is taken from Pinhas."}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n                "}
