{"text":"מי שברך. ומגביהין וגוללין. כשמגביהין הס״ת מביטין נגד הכתב של ס״ת ואומרין:"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"After the reading, the Torah scroll is lifted up and rolled together again. When the Torah scroll is being lifted up, one says:"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n                "}
{"start":"j:transclude","attrs":{"type":"external","target":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/vezot_hatorah"}}
