{"text":"\n                    "}
{"start":"t:head","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"הפטרה ליום א׳ של ראש השנה."}
{"end":"t:head"}
{"tail":"\n                    "}
{"start":"t:head","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"Haphtarah"}
{"end":"t:head"}
{"tail":"\n                    "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description"}}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"קודם קריאת ההפטרה ואחר שנגמר הגולל, יברך המפטיר ברכה זו:"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"Blessing before the Haphtorah:"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n                    "}
{"start":"j:transclude","attrs":{"type":"external","target":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkhot_haftarah/asher_bachar"}}
